        {
          "row": 4,
          "col": 1,
          "html": "Run the specified .rsc file after reset. That way you can load your custom configuration. <br/><br/><strong>Warning:</strong> If a specific .rsc file execution takes more than 2 minutes, a script will fail, and LOG will contain <em>\"runtime limit exceeded\"</em> or in rare cases <em>\"std failure: timeout\"</em> error. <br/>"
        },
        {
          "row": 5,
          "col": 1,
          "html": "Run the <em>caps-mode</em> script after configuration reset. <br/>"
        }
      ]
    }
